LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022 - Update 1)
# ==============================================================================
# Passo 1.3a: Equilibracao NPT a 300 K e P = 0 para obter a(300 K)
# Caixa 8x8x8 (2048 atomos), dt = 1.0 fs, 40 ps totais (10 ps eq + 30 ps prod)
# ==============================================================================
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

variable        n equal 8

lattice         fcc 3.614925
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.614925 3.614925 3.614925
region          box block 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0 ${n}
region          box block 0 8 0 ${n} 0 ${n}
region          box block 0 8 0 8 0 ${n}
region          box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (28.9194 28.9194 28.9194)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 2048 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (28.9194 28.9194 28.9194)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass            1 63.546

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep        0.001
velocity        all create 600.0 492845 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 0.0 0.0 1.0

variable        t_ps  equal step*dt
variable        T     equal temp
variable        P_GPa equal press/1.0e4
variable        a_A   equal lx/v_n
variable        PE    equal pe

fix             out all print 20 "${t_ps} ${T} ${P_GPa} ${a_A} ${PE}" file npt_300K_8x8x8.dat screen no title "# t_ps Temp_K P_GPa a_A PE_eV"

thermo          5000
thermo_style    custom step temp press lx pe
run             40000
Neighbor list info ...
  update every 1 steps, delay 0 steps, check yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 7.50679
  ghost atom cutoff = 7.50679
  binsize = 3.753395, bins = 8 8 8
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair eam/alloy, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/atomonly/newton
      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
